      "Floor life is the cumulative time a moisture-sensitive device may stay outside its moisture barrier bag in factory conditions that J-STD-033 treats as no more than 30 °C and no more than 60 % RH. It is not shelf life, not a reflow count, not solderability life and not a quality rating. The budget exists to limit moisture uptake before reflow.",
